                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><i class="lni lni-checkmark-circle text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 text-base"></i> PBKDF2 &amp; TOTP 2FA</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><i class="lni lni-checkmark-circle text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 text-base"></i> RFC 8628 Device Flow</span>
